    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Real Dice, Real Luck!</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Farkle with Friends</i>\u2014a thrilling multiplayer dice game where <strong>physics-based rolling</strong> ensures that every outcome is truly random, not just computer-generated. Compete with friends online in fast-paced rounds where every roll could make or break your chances of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udc46 Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Dice Rolls</strong> \u2013 No hidden RNG! Your dice roll is <strong>completely determined by physics</strong>, so every game is fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Fun</strong> \u2013 Play with friends in online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Scoring System</strong> \u2013 Earn points through special combinations, like sequences, pairs, and high-value rolls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong> \u2013 Will you play it safe or go for a big gamble? The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Dice Skins</strong> \u2013 Win games, complete challenges, and customize your dice with unique skins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Dice Rolls</strong> \u2013 Doubles, triples, and even full six-dice rolls come with their own twists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick &amp; Engaging Matches</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rigged numbers, no unfair algorithms\u2014just <strong>pure skill, luck, and physics</strong>. Are you ready to roll?<br><br>**Please Note: Mouse and keyboard may be required in some circumstances**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from the Developer: This is my first published game. There are some bugs, but nothing game breaking. I appreciate you taking the time to check out my game! &lt;3</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Real Dice, Real Luck!</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Farkle with Friends</i>\u2014a thrilling multiplayer dice game where <strong>physics-based rolling</strong> ensures that every outcome is truly random, not just computer-generated. Compete with friends online in fast-paced rounds where every roll could make or break your chances of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udc46 Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Dice Rolls</strong> \u2013 No hidden RNG! Your dice roll is <strong>completely determined by physics</strong>, so every game is fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Fun</strong> \u2013 Play with friends in online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Scoring System</strong> \u2013 Earn points through special combinations, like sequences, pairs, and high-value rolls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong> \u2013 Will you play it safe or go for a big gamble? The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Dice Skins</strong> \u2013 Win games, complete challenges, and customize your dice with unique skins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Dice Rolls</strong> \u2013 Doubles, triples, and even full six-dice rolls come with their own twists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick &amp; Engaging Matches</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rigged numbers, no unfair algorithms\u2014just <strong>pure skill, luck, and physics</strong>. Are you ready to roll?<br><br>**Please Note: Mouse and keyboard may be required in some circumstances**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note from the Developer: This is my first published game. There are some bugs, but nothing game breaking. I appreciate you taking the time to check out my game! &lt;3</p>",
    "short_description": "Play solo or with friends in this fast-paced dice game where strategy meets luck. With real physics, every roll is truly random. No tricks\u2014just skill and chance! Unlock unique dice skins and show off your style as you roll your way to victory!",
